OL,3,GNEWSAChildminder who left 27 children
OL,4,Aalone in her home pleads guilty to
OL,5,Aneglect
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Dunfermline childminder has admitted
OL,8,Fleaving more than 20 children she was
OL,9,Fcaring for alone and unsupervised in
OL,10,Fher home.
OL,12,FAmanda Mathewson, 55, pleaded guilty at
OL,13,FKirkcaldy Sheriff Court to neglect and
OL,14,Fabandoning children in her care.
OL,16,FHer offending took place at a number of
OL,17,Flocations in Dunfermline and elsewhere
OL,18,Fin Fife.
OL,20,FThe court heard Mathewson had 27
OL,21,Fchildren in her home, 19 more than she
OL,22,Fwas licensed to look after.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
